Package: axon-gaming-tweaks
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Axon OS <axon-os@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: systemd-zram-generator, udev
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/ProjectDEV-git/Axon-OS
Description: Axon OS system settings for gaming
 Kernel and systemd settings that Windows games running under Proton need:
 a large memory-map limit, a high open-file limit, the ntsync device when
 the kernel has it, and compressed-RAM (zram) swap.
